.TH PSGeluS 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSGeluS

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/activation.h>

.I
PSFloat  
.br
\fBPSGeluS\fR(\fIPSFloat val\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
GELU (Gaussian Error Linear Units) activation function for scalars.
.br
It takes the scalar \fIval\fR as argument and returns a \fIPFloat\fR scalar.
.br
For info about GELU:
.br
  \fIhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1606.08415\fR
.br
The equivalent function to be used with vectors/matrices is \fIPSGelu\fR.
.br
The derivative of this function is \fIPSGeluDerivativeS\fR.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
GELU scalar result.

.SH SEE ALSO
PSGelu(3), PSGeluDerivativeS(3)
